    "title": "otosora v0.6.3",
    "notes": "# Otosora 0.6.3\n\n## Faster streaming\n- A tapped stream song starts sooner. yt-dlp is now prepared when Otosora opens instead of on the first tap, and each lookup skips two downloads Otosora never used.\n- After a search, the first three songs are looked up in the background, so tapping one of them usually plays at once.\n- Search shows YouTube Music's results as soon as they arrive. Covers and remixes found on YouTube fill in a moment later.\n- A stalled connection now fails after 10 seconds instead of leaving the song loading.\n\n## Fixes\n- Streamed songs show their length and progress instead of 0:00 / 0:00.\n- Next and previous wait for a streamed song to be ready, so it starts instead of timing out.\n",
